及份量，須自助回收餐盤！\n\n最後兩人加了一球麵+半碗飯，飽到差點走不出去🤩\n-\n☑️僅收現金\n☑️提供常溫、冰飲用水\n☑️有洗手間",null,[0,33]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12746894762429256990/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN3ZEZOSGVERmFhelIwWVVkR1JWb3piRFJVUlZaWlkwWmtiMDVGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12746894762429256990/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN3ZEZOSGVERmFhelIwWVVkR1JWb3piRFJVUlZaWlkwWmtiMDVGUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12746894762429256990/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN3ZEZOSGVERmFhelIwWVVkR1JWb3piRFJVUlZaWlkwWmtiMDVGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12746894762429256990/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN3ZEZOSGVERmFhelIwWVVkR1JWb3piRFJVUlZaWlkwWmtiMDVGUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12746894762429256990/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN3ZEZOSGVERmFhelIwWVVkR1JWb3piRFJVUlZaWlkwWmtiMDVGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12746894762429256990/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN3ZEZOSGVERmFhelIwWVVkR1JWb3piRFJVUlZaWlkwWmtiMDVGUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,23785,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2swdFNHeDFaazR0YUdGRVozbDRURVZZY0Zkb05FRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x75824ec23a79bebd!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOk0tSGx1Zk4taGFEZ3l4TEVYcFdoNEE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2swdFNHeDFaazR0YUdGRVozbDRURVZZY0Zkb05FRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2swdFNHeDFaazR0YUdGRVozbDRURVZZY0Zkb05FRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2swdFNHeDFaazR0YUdGRVozbDRURVZZY0Zkb05FRRILMGROQXd6SDlaVTIaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09rMHRTR3gxWms0dGFHRkVaM2w0VEVWWWNGZG9ORUUSCzBkTkF3ekg5WlUyIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARvb55OsJOgnUqCzBkTkF3ekg5WlUy\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003